  "solution": "1. – and +\n\n__**588 ÷ 28**__** **× 32 - 72 + 160 = 760\n\n⇒ __**21 **____**× 32**__ - 72 + 160 = 760\n\n⇒ __**672**__ - 72 __**+**____** 160**__ = 760\n\n⇒ __**832 - 72**__ = 760\n\n⇒ 760 = 760\n\n2. ÷ and –\n\n588 - __**28 × 32**__ + __**72 **____**÷**____** 160**__ = 760\n\n⇒ __**588**__ - 896 __**+ 0.45**__ = 760\n\n⇒ __**588.45 - 896**__ = 760\n\n⇒ -307.55 ≠ 760\n\n3. + and ×\n\n__**588 ÷ 28**__ + __**32 × 72**__ – 160 = 760\n\n⇒ __**21 + 2304**__ - 160 = 760\n\n⇒ __**2325 - 160**__ = 760\n\n⇒ 2165 ≠ 760\n\n4. ÷ and +\n\n588 + 28 × __**32 ÷ 72**__ – 160 = 760\n\n⇒ 588 + __**28 × 0.45**__ - 160 = 760\n\n⇒ __**588 + 12.6**__ - 160 = 760\n\n⇒ __**600.6 - 160**__ = 760\n\n⇒ 440.6 ≠ 760\n\nHence, '**– and +**' is the correct answer.",
